        "title": "Environmental Engineering - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Environmental engineering applies engineering principles to protect human health and the\nnatural environment. Five technical domains, one regulatory backbone, one unifying\nquantitative tool (mass balance)."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#003",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
